/* TkTracker — base localization.

   English is the development language, so most UI copy is written inline in the
   SwiftUI views and resolves to itself. This table holds the strings that are
   built up in code (where a literal would not be extractable) plus the ones
   whose wording is shared across surfaces.

   To add a language, copy this file to <code>.lproj/Localizable.strings beside
   it (e.g. fr.lproj) and translate the values only — never the keys. */

